<title>USA: Registry to issue stock to buy Calif. co.</title>
<headline>Registry to issue stock to buy Calif. co.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registry Inc said Wednesday that it will issue about 1.7 million common shares to acquire Application Resources Inc, a San Francisco information technology services company.</p>
<p>Registry said it has definitively agreed to acquire Application Resources in a deal that is expected to close by November 27.  </p>
<p>Registry, provides information technology services such as network systems consulting and documentation services.</p>
<p>It said its acquisition raises the number of Registry branch offices to 29 and the number of its information technology consultants to 2200 nationwide.</p>
</text>
